<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Attack Event Response Playbook - Incident #c7049a6c</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a0e27 0%, #1a1f3a 100%);
            color: #e2e8f0;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 20px;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: white;
        }

        .incident-id {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            opacity: 0.9;
            color: #f0f4ff;
        }

        .critical-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #991b1b 100%);
            border: 2px solid #ef4444;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.5);
            animation: pulse-border 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse-border {
            0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.5); }
            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.8); }
        }

        .critical-banner h2 {
            color: white;
            font-size: 1.8em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .critical-banner .icon {
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(26, 31, 58, 0.8);
            border: 1px solid rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #a5b4fc;
            font-size: 1.3em;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #667eea;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .stat {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2);
        }

        .stat:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .stat-label {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .stat-value {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .badge-critical {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #991b1b 100%);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.5);
        }

        .badge-warning {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        .badge-success {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        .badge-info {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #2563eb 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        .badge-pending {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6b7280 0%, #4b5563 100%);
            color: white;
        }

        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 40px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .timeline::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 15px;
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        }

        .timeline-item {
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding: 15px;
            background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.1);
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 3px solid #667eea;
        }

        .timeline-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: -29px;
            top: 20px;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #667eea;
            border: 3px solid #0a0e27;
        }

        .timeline-item.active::before {
            background: #f59e0b;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.8);
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.8); }
            50% { box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(245, 158, 11, 1); }
        }

        .timeline-item.completed::before {
            background: #10b981;
        }

        .timeline-time {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .timeline-title {
            color: #e2e8f0;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .timeline-content {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-size: 0.95em;
        }

        .workflow-steps {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .workflow-step {
            background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.1);
            border: 2px solid rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .workflow-step.completed {
            border-color: #10b981;
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
        }

        .workflow-step.active {
            border-color: #f59e0b;
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
        }

        .workflow-step-number {
            position: absolute;
            top: -15px;
            left: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: white;
        }

        .workflow-step.completed .workflow-step-number {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
        }

        .workflow-step.active .workflow-step-number {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);
        }

        .workflow-step-title {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            margin-left: 50px;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }

        .workflow-step-content {
            margin-left: 50px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        .checklist {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .checklist-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            background: rgba(26, 31, 58, 0.6);
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .checklist-item:hover {
            background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2);
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }

        .checklist-item input[type="checkbox"] {
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            accent-color: #667eea;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }

        .checklist-item.checked {
            opacity: 0.6;
            text-decoration: line-through;
        }

        .action-priority {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }

        .priority-immediate {
            background: #dc2626;
            color: white;
        }

        .priority-short {
            background: #f59e0b;
            color: white;
        }

        .priority-long {
            background: #3b82f6;
            color: white;
        }

        .code-block {
            background: #0f1729;
            border: 1px solid #667eea;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            overflow-x: auto;
            color: #a5b4fc;
        }

        .code-block-title {
            color: #667eea;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        .rule-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            margin: 5px 5px 5px 0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            font-weight: 600;
            background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid #dc2626;
            color: #fca5a5;
        }

        .ip-address {
            background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2);
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            color: #a5b4fc;
            border: 1px solid #667eea;
        }

        .evidence-item {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 41, 0.8);
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .evidence-item-title {
            color: #667eea;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .evidence-content {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        .stakeholder-matrix {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .stakeholder-card {
            background: rgba(26, 31, 58, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px;
        }

        .stakeholder-role {
            color: #667eea;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .stakeholder-name {
            color: #e2e8f0;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .stakeholder-contact {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        .progress-bar {
            width: 100%;
            height: 30px;
            background: rgba(26, 31, 58, 0.8);
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border: 1px solid rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.3);
        }

        .progress-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            transition: width 0.5s ease;
        }

        .attack-vector-viz {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.1);
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.3);
        }

        .vector-node {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            background: rgba(26, 31, 58, 0.8);
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 2px solid #667eea;
            min-width: 150px;
        }

        .vector-node.attacker {
            border-color: #dc2626;
            background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.2);
        }

        .vector-node.target {
            border-color: #f59e0b;
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
        }

        .vector-arrow {
            font-size: 2em;
            color: #dc2626;
            animation: slide 1s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes slide {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
            50% { transform: translateX(10px); }
        }

        .section-divider {
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #667eea 50%, transparent 100%);
            margin: 40px 0;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        th {
            background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2);
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: left;
            color: #a5b4fc;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #667eea;
        }

        td {
            padding: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.2);
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }

        tr:hover {
            background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.1);
        }

        .full-width {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .attack-vector-viz {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 20px;
            }

            .vector-arrow {
                transform: rotate(90deg);
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>🚨 Attack Event Response Playbook</h1>
            <div class="incident-id">Incident ID: c7049a6c-8ae4-4f11-bdf8-c58a154c3bba</div>
        </header>

        <!-- Critical Banner -->
        <div class="critical-banner">
            <h2><span class="icon">⚠️</span> ACTIVE SECURITY INCIDENT - EXPLOITED ATTACK</h2>
            <p>A successful exploitation has been detected targeting cargo-cats-webhookservice. Immediate action required.</p>
            <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
                <span class="badge badge-critical">EXPLOITED</span>
                <span class="badge badge-warning">33 PROBES</span>
                <span class="badge badge-info">PYTHON SERVICE</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 1: Active Incident Overview -->
        <h2 style="color: #a5b4fc; font-size: 2em; margin-bottom: 20px;">📊 Active Incident Overview</h2>

        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Attack Status</h3>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Severity:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value"><span class="badge badge-critical">CRITICAL</span></span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Status:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value"><span class="badge badge-warning">EXPLOITED</span></span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Attack Type:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value">Multi-Vector</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Total Probes:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value">33</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Duration:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value">41 seconds</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Affected Service</h3>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Application:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value">cargo-cats-webhookservice</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Technology:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value">Python</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Environment:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value">Production</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Impact Level:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value"><span class="badge badge-critical">HIGH</span></span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Source Information</h3>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Source IP:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value"><span class="ip-address">10.1.3.116</span></span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Network:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value">Internal (10.x.x.x)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Geolocation:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value">Unknown (Private IP)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="stat">
                    <span class="stat-label">Known Threat:</span>
                    <span class="stat-value"><span class="badge badge-warning">Under Investigation</span></span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Attack Timeline -->
        <div class="card full-width">
            <h3>Attack Timeline</h3>
            <div class="timeline">
                <div class="timeline-item completed">
                    <div class="timeline-time">2026-01-15 21:31:07 UTC</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">Attack Initiated</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">Initial probe detected from IP 10.1.3.116 targeting cargo-cats-webhookservice</div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-item completed">
                    <div class="timeline-time">2026-01-15 21:31:12 UTC</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">Command Injection Detected</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">Multiple command injection attempts detected - attacker attempting to execute system commands</div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-item completed">
                    <div class="timeline-time">2026-01-15 21:31:24 UTC</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">SQL Injection Attempts</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">SQL injection payloads detected - targeting database layer</div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-item completed">
                    <div class="timeline-time">2026-01-15 21:31:35 UTC</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">Path Traversal Exploitation</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">Path traversal attack successful - unauthorized file system access achieved</div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-item completed">
                    <div class="timeline-time">2026-01-15 21:31:48 UTC</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">Attack Concluded</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">Attack activity ceased - 33 total probes recorded</div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-item active">
                    <div class="timeline-time">2026-01-15 21:32:00 UTC (Now)</div>
                    <div class="timeline-title">Incident Response Active</div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">Security team engaged - containment procedures in progress</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Rules Triggered -->
        <div class="card full-width">
            <h3>Attack Vectors & Rules Triggered</h3>
            <div class="attack-vector-viz">
                <div class="vector-node attacker">
                    <div style="font-size: 2em;">🎭</div>
                    <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-weight: 600;">Attacker</div>
                    <div style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9em;">10.1.3.116</div>
                </div>
                <div class="vector-arrow">➤➤➤</div>
                <div class="vector-node">
                    <div style="font-size: 2em;">🛡️</div>
                    <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-weight: 600;">Contrast Protect</div>
                    <div style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9em;">Detection Active</div>
                </div>
                <div class="vector-arrow">➤➤➤</div>
                <div class="vector-node target">
                    <div style="font-size: 2em;">🎯</div>
                    <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-weight: 600;">Target</div>
                    <div style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9em;">cargo-cats-webhookservice</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <strong style="color: #a5b4fc;">Rules Triggered:</strong><br><br>
                <span class="rule-tag">🚨 Command Injection</span>
                <span class="rule-tag">🚨 Path Traversal</span>
                <span class="rule-tag">🚨 SQL Injection</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-divider"></div>

        <!-- Section 2: Incident Response Workflow -->
        <h2 style="color: #a5b4fc; font-size: 2em; margin-bottom: 20px;">🔄 Incident Response Workflow (NIST Framework)</h2>

        <div class="card full-width">
            <h3>Response Progress</h3>
            <div class="progress-bar">
                <div class="progress-fill" style="width: 40%;">40% Complete - Containment Phase</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="workflow-steps">
            <div class="workflow-step completed">
                <div class="workflow-step-number">1</div>
                <div class="workflow-step-title">Detection & Analysis <span class="badge badge-success">COMPLETED</span></div>
                <div class="workflow-step-content">
                    <p><strong>Completed Actions:</strong></p>
                    <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 10px;">
                        <li>✓ Attack detected by Contrast Protect at 21:31:07 UTC</li>
                        <li>✓ Alert generated and security team notified</li>
                        <li>✓ Initial analysis completed - multi-vector attack confirmed</li>
                        <li>✓ Attack pattern analyzed: Command Injection, SQL Injection, Path Traversal</li>
                        <li>✓ Impact assessment: cargo-cats-webhookservice compromised</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p style="margin-top: 10px;"><strong>Lead:</strong> Security Operations Team</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step active">
                <div class="workflow-step-number">2</div>
                <div class="workflow-step-title">Containment <span class="badge badge-warning">IN PROGRESS</span></div>
                <div class="workflow-step-content">
                    <p><strong>Current Actions:</strong></p>
                    <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 10px;">
                        <li>⏳ Blocking source IP 10.1.3.116 at firewall level</li>
                        <li>⏳ Isolating affected service from production network</li>
                        <li>⏳ Disabling compromised API endpoints</li>
                        <li>⏳ Creating forensic snapshot of affected systems</li>
                        <li>⏳ Monitoring for lateral movement attempts</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p style="margin-top: 10px;"><strong>Lead:</strong> Incident Response Team</p>
                    <p style="margin-top: 5px;"><strong>ETA:</strong> 15 minutes</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-step-number">3</div>
                <div class="workflow-step-title">Eradication <span class="badge badge-pending">PENDING</span></div>
                <div class="workflow-step-content">
                    <p><strong>Planned Actions:</strong></p>
                    <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 10px;">
                        <li>Remove attacker access and backdoors</li>
                        <li>Patch exploited vulnerabilities</li>
                        <li>Update security rules and signatures</li>
                        <li>Rebuild compromised systems from clean images</li>
                        <li>Verify complete removal of attacker presence</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p style="margin-top: 10px;"><strong>Lead:</strong> Engineering & Security Teams</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="workflow-step">
                <div class="workflow-step-number">4</div>
                <div class="workflow-step-title">Recovery <span class="badge badge-pending">PENDING</span></div>
                <div class="workflow-step-content">
                    <p><strong>Planned Actions:</strong></p>
                    <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 10px;">
                        <li>Restore services from verified clean backups</li>
                        <li>Implement enhanced monitoring</li>
